          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 89140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cuando queremos asegurarnos de que una colección de valores no pueda tener duplicados, la almacenamos en un <strong>set</strong>, como estos códigos postales aquí.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'SW1A', 'SY3', 'B44'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un conjunto guarda valores sin duplicados. Rodéalos con llaves <code>{}</code>. Guarda los códigos postales en un conjunto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;SW1A&quot;, &quot;SY3&quot;, &quot;B44&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 89375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Los conjuntos como <code>postcodes</code> son colecciones de valores como las listas, pero no permiten valores duplicados.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>postcodes</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un conjunto es una colección como una lista, pero elimina duplicados. Nombra la variable que almacena este conjunto para que funcione la impresión.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"postcode\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>postcodes</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
